HAI
    WAZZUP
        I HAS A trueValue ITZ WIN
        I HAS A falseValue ITZ FAIL
        I HAS A trueNumbr
        I HAS A falseNumbr
        I HAS A trueNumbar
        I HAS A falseNumbar
    BUHBYE

    trueNumbr R MAEK trueValue A NUMBR
    falseNumbr R MAEK falseValue A NUMBR
    trueNumbar R MAEK trueValue A NUMBAR
    falseNumbar R MAEK falseValue A NUMBAR

    VISIBLE trueNumbr
    VISIBLE falseNumbr
    VISIBLE trueNumbar
    VISIBLE falseNumbar
KTHXBYE